  "_comment": "Action space for the autonomous attack-selection agent, derived from the supervisor's catalogue. Each action: session_label (HA marker category), kill-chain phase, MITRE ATT&CK id, tool, script that runs it, preconditions (state predicates that must hold to be a legal action), params, and 'match' substrings used by assemble.py to map a run's cmd.txt back to this action.",
  "state_predicates": {
    "host.alive": "target responded to discovery",
